    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "Questions 1 to 4 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n1. A) Changing his major. C) Revising his graduation thesis.\nB) His family situation. D) His passion for Art History.",
      "block_bbox": [
        70,
