      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "2. A) He doesn't think it legitimate to depend on his father.\nB) He thinks his financial situation has now changed.\nC) He doesn't think it will provide him with a living.\nD) He thinks it nourishes the financially secure only.",
      "block_bbox": [
        67,
