    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "3. A) Try his best to socialize and build a network in the art industry.\nB) Seek financially viable employment opportunities after graduation.\nC) Investigate all possible ways to become a celebrity in the art world.\nD) Strike a balance between intellectual pursuits and financial security.",
